ncluding Instagram, TikTok, LinkedIn, and YouTube, from one dashboard. It includes analytics, a unified inbox, team collaboration, and an MCP server so your own AI can manage posting. Plans start at {price} per month with a 14-day free trial."},"2":{"q":"Which social media platforms do you support?","a":"Postify supports nine platforms: Instagram, Facebook, Threads, LinkedIn, X (Twitter), Pinterest, TikTok, YouTube, and Plative. You can connect multiple accounts from each platform and manage all your content from one centralized dashboard."},"3":{"q":"Can I schedule posts in advance?","a":"Yes! Postify schedules posts weeks or months in advance across all nine supported platforms. It can suggest strong times to post based on your audience engagement, or you can choose your own custom times for maximum flexibility."},"4":{"q":"What types of content can I post?","a":"You can post photos, videos, carousels, stories, and text-based content. We support various file formats including JPG, PNG, MP4, and more, and we check your content against each platform\'s requirements so your posts publish correctly."},"5":{"q":"Do you provide analytics and insights?","a":"Yes. Postify includes detailed analytics on post performance, audience demographics, engagement rates, and optimal posting times, across every connected profile. The insights help you understand what content resonates with your audience and when they\'re most active."},"6":{"q":"Can my team collaborate on content creation?","a":"Yes, our platform supports team collaboration. You can invite team members, assign roles and permissions, create approval workflows, and work together on content calendars. Perfect for agencies and businesses with multiple content creators."},"7":{"q":"Is there a free trial?","a":"Yes. Every plan comes with a 14-day free trial so you can explore all features. A card is required to start, but you will not be charged until the trial ends, and you can cancel anytime before then. There is no free-forever plan, but our paid plans scale with your needs, from individual creators to agencies."},"8":{"q":"How secure is my social media data?","a":"Security is our top priority. We use industry-standard encryption, secure OAuth connections with social platforms, and never store your social media passwords. Your data is protected with enterprise-grade security measures."},"9":{"q":"How do I get started?","a":"Getting started is simple! Sign up for an account, connect your social media profiles using our secure OAuth process, and start creating and scheduling your content. Our onboarding guide will walk you through each step."},"10":{"q":"Do you offer an MCP (Model Context Protocol) server?","a":"Yes! Postify provides a dedicated MCP server. You can connect Claude, ChatGPT, or custom AI agents directly to it, so your own AI assistant can act as a social media manager that creates, schedules, and analyzes posts across your Postify profiles, always under your control."}},"neutralOffer":{"items":{"1":{"a":"Postify is a social media scheduling tool that plans, schedules, and publishes posts to nine platforms, including Instagram, TikTok, LinkedIn, and YouTube, from one dashboard. It includes analytics, a unified inbox, team collaboration, and an MCP server so your own AI can manage posting. Plans start at {price} per month."},"7":{"q":"Is there a free plan?","a":"There is no free-forever plan. Paid plans start at {price} per month and scale with your needs, from individual creators to agencies. Checkout shows exactly what you pay and when before you confirm, and you can switch plans or cancel anytime."}}}},"pricingFaq":{"title":"Pricing questions","items":{"1":{"q":"Do I need a credit card to start?","a":"Yes. A card is required to start your 14-day free trial, but you will not be charged until the trial ends, and you can cancel anytime before then."},"2":{"q":"What counts as a profile?","a":"A profile is one brand workspace that connects up to 9 social accounts, one per platform (Instagram, Facebook, Threads, LinkedIn, TikTok, X, YouTube, Pinterest, and Plative). Higher plans include more profiles."},"3":{"q":"Can I change plans later?","a":"Yes. You can upgrade or downgrade at any time from your dashboard, and your limits adjust right away."},"4":{"q":"What happens when my trial ends?","a":"If you keep your subscription, billing starts on the plan you chose. If you cancel before the trial ends, you will not be charged."},"5":{"q":"Do you offer yearly billing?","a":"Yes. Every Postify plan offers yearly billing with 2 months free, which brings the entry plan to {yearlyPrice} per month instead of {price}."},"6":{"q":"How do I cancel?","a":"Open the billing settings in your dashboard and choose Manage Billing, or contact support. Cancelling stops future billing. If you cancel before your free trial ends, you are not charged. If you subscribed through the App Store or Google Play, cancel there."},"7":{"q":"Do you offer refunds?","a":"When you cancel, your plan stays active until the end of the period you have already paid for. We do not refund partial periods unless the law requires it. The Terms of Service have the details."},"8":{"q":"Which platforms can I post to?","a":"Instagram, Facebook, Threads, LinkedIn, TikTok, X, YouTube, Pinterest, and Plative. Every plan can publish to all of them. Plans differ in limits such as the number of profiles and team members."},"9":{"q":"Can I add team members?","a":"Yes. Every plan includes at least one team member and higher plans include more, as the comparison table shows. On Starter and above you can also buy extra team member and profile seats from your billing settings."},"10":{"q":"Can I export my data?","a":"Yes. Email privacy@postify.tech and we will send you a copy of your data in a common electronic format. We aim to respond within one month."}},"neutralOffer":{"items":{"1":{"q":"How do I pay for Postify?","a":"Plans are paid by card through a secure checkout, which shows exactly wha